From: Glib Shpychka <23005347+gshpychka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:15:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agents): let completion turns ask their requester
 questions

A subagent completion or settle turn is dispatched as a system caller with
the default operator.write scope, and its tool calls stay within that
ceiling. question.request needs operator.questions, so the ask falls back
to session-scoped access, which requires a verified human profile that a
channel-started run never has.

The completion dispatch grants operator.questions alongside
operator.write. Operator-started completions keep the operator's own
scopes.

